# INVWINPX.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:PREVX.CFG, a settings file that is not there: the preview at
# level 1 and beside a search's results, and the assemblies' pane
# without assemblies.  READER sees the preview of item 1; from it CTRL-E
# is refused as it is in the list, and ENTER opens the item's form in
# view mode.  The Find box's results for Tandon show item 2 with its
# preview, F6 going there and ESC back; View > Pane beside the list
# hides it there, and on the item list with it.  Items > Assemblies, an
# empty list, still shows its own pane, the parts, empty and disabled,
# F6 doing nothing, and Items > Categories' list, closed, fetches
# nothing into it; Locations keeps its pane too, its entry checked.
# The end by Exit: TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/PREVX.CFG is the settings file it
# leaves.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPX.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/framchk.py checks it.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S READER
K F6
S PANE
K CTRL-E
S REFUSED
K ENTER ENTER
S FORM
K ESC
S CLOSED
K CTRL-F
T Tandon
K ENTER
S FOUND
K F6
S FPANE
K ESC
S FLIST
K ALT-V P
S ALONE
K ESC ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-I A
S ASSY
K F6
S ASSYKEY
K ALT-I C ESC
S ASSYCAT
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
K ALT-V
S LOCMENU
K ESC ESC ALT-F X
